    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1281">

                <pb facs="0999" n="923" xml:id="pg923"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.11D29/155</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Price to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-12-12T09:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 12, 1916, 9 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Panaman Minister for Foreign Affairs has sent to me remittance for twelve
                    thousand three hundred and fifty dollars stating that it is in payment of award
                    of arbitration award Fourth of July riot on account of the death of one and
                    wounding sixteen Americans. Same will be forwarded by mail steamer tomorrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Price</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
